WEBVTT

01:40.620 --> 01:45.720
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.370 --> 01:50.830
[Episode 21]

01:53.330 --> 01:55.720
[Beast Kingdom]

02:00.140 --> 02:04.100
[Herb Clinic]

02:04.000 --> 02:04.790
Ladies,

02:04.790 --> 02:06.310
I've found a courtyard for you.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.200
Please have a seat for now.

02:07.200 --> 02:09.060
I'll take you there immediately.

02:14.240 --> 02:17.900
I didn't expect Miss Dongfang to come to the Beast Kingdom as well.

02:18.280 --> 02:19.430
Did you tell her

02:19.630 --> 02:21.800
you came here to investigate the Black Fox?

02:21.800 --> 02:23.400
She probably figured it out.

02:25.710 --> 02:27.800
But the key issue is that

02:27.870 --> 02:29.800
the first clue I found

02:29.910 --> 02:31.630
is related to Miss Dongfang's mother,

02:31.630 --> 02:32.590
Jiang Juanxue.

02:34.310 --> 02:35.880
She's the Saintess of the Northern Hill Sect,

02:35.880 --> 02:40.210
and the Northern Hill Sect is closely connected to the origin of the Black Fox.

02:44.060 --> 02:46.210
[Yajing Mansion]

02:51.560 --> 02:53.750
This is the courtyard I picked out

02:53.750 --> 02:55.280
based on your preferences.

02:55.610 --> 02:56.829
It looks a little plain,

02:56.829 --> 02:59.120
but it's in a great location—quiet and elegant.

02:59.120 --> 03:00.250
Thank you very much.

03:05.750 --> 03:07.030
As for the person you're looking for,

03:07.030 --> 03:08.680
things are a bit complicated.

03:08.680 --> 03:10.590
Please be careful.

03:12.630 --> 03:13.960
I'll take my leave then.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.079
Huaizhu.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.590
I quite like it here.

03:21.310 --> 03:22.280
It's not bad.

03:22.520 --> 03:24.710
But I really didn't expect to run into

03:24.840 --> 03:27.370
Young Master Wangquan here in Beast Kingdom.

03:27.630 --> 03:29.120
They just saved us.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.710
I know.

03:30.800 --> 03:33.150
That's why I thanked them.

03:33.280 --> 03:35.610
And I didn't really make fun of them, did I?

03:39.079 --> 03:39.960
Qinlan,

03:41.000 --> 03:42.450
why have you never asked me

03:42.450 --> 03:44.380
why I brought you to Beast Kingdom?

03:44.520 --> 03:45.520
Why should I ask?

03:46.030 --> 03:47.800
Everything you do is right.

03:48.710 --> 03:50.079
You trust me that much?

03:50.310 --> 03:51.310
Of course.

03:51.430 --> 03:53.750
You're one of a kind to me.

03:56.150 --> 03:57.190
I'm going out for a walk,

03:57.190 --> 03:59.390
to get familiar with the surroundings.

04:08.430 --> 04:10.910
Erzhu Yu, the former owner of Drunken Dream Tower,

04:10.910 --> 04:13.000
was assassinated a year ago.

04:13.750 --> 04:16.680
The identity of the current leader remains unknown.

04:22.270 --> 04:24.360
Jiang Juanxue once trained a woman,

04:24.830 --> 04:26.000
named Erzhu Yu.

04:26.310 --> 04:28.360
She was the owner of Drunken Dream Tower.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.360
Was?

04:29.360 --> 04:30.040
Yes.

04:30.430 --> 04:32.630
She died mysteriously a year ago.

04:34.860 --> 04:36.070
After Erzhu Yu's death,

04:36.070 --> 04:38.159
there should be something left in Drunken Dream Tower.

04:38.159 --> 04:39.560
Who is the current owner?

04:39.720 --> 04:41.800
The current owner of Drunken Dream Tower is very mysterious.

04:41.800 --> 04:43.000
No one knows their identity.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.720
I've already sent people to investigate.

04:44.720 --> 04:46.600
We should have news soon.

04:47.390 --> 04:49.320
But for now, the lead has gone cold,

04:49.510 --> 04:51.950
and the Beast Kingdom has closed the city gates.

04:51.950 --> 04:55.070
The current situation is quite unfavorable for us.

04:58.510 --> 05:01.710
Who leaked the information to the ruler of Beast Kingdom?

05:02.310 --> 05:03.370
Useless!

05:04.040 --> 05:05.750
You've been in seclusion for three days

05:05.750 --> 05:07.610
and haven't found a trace of them.

05:07.630 --> 05:10.390
Could Wangquan Hongye really have grown wings and flown away?

05:10.390 --> 05:13.520
Perhaps Jin Renfeng's information was false,

05:13.630 --> 05:15.920
and Wangquan Hongye never came at all.

05:15.950 --> 05:16.920
You fool!

05:18.070 --> 05:19.040
What good

05:20.240 --> 05:21.570
would lying to me do him?

05:26.270 --> 05:27.930
Tell Anayan to come and see me.

05:28.310 --> 05:28.870
Yes.

05:29.040 --> 05:30.060
Your Majesty.

05:32.340 --> 05:33.680
There's no need to summon me.

05:32.480 --> 05:34.860
[Anayan, National Preceptor of Beast Kingdom]

05:34.750 --> 05:36.310
I'm already here.

05:40.770 --> 05:41.450
Good.

05:47.870 --> 05:50.290
I went against all opposition

05:50.310 --> 05:52.310
to make you the National Preceptor.

05:52.460 --> 05:53.430
Why?

05:53.800 --> 05:55.810
Because you personally told me

05:55.870 --> 05:59.000
you would bring me Wangquan Hongye's head as repayment.

06:00.950 --> 06:02.630
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

06:03.070 --> 06:07.310
The assassins sent to kill Wangquan Hongye are already on their way.

06:07.490 --> 06:10.120
Then I'll wait and see.

06:33.690 --> 06:34.860
Make way, make way!

06:34.890 --> 06:35.590
Move!

06:35.610 --> 06:36.470
Move!

06:36.490 --> 06:37.230
Move!

06:40.180 --> 06:42.390
I'll go down and take a look. Wait for me here.

06:42.390 --> 06:43.600
Someone reported that Ruyi Pavilion

06:43.600 --> 06:45.000
is harboring members of the Yiqi Alliance!

06:45.000 --> 06:45.750
Search!

06:45.780 --> 06:47.430
Search every room!

06:47.430 --> 06:48.240
Yes!

06:52.560 --> 06:53.890
Young Master Wangquan,

06:53.920 --> 06:56.980
Ms. Qingmu told me to take you out through the back door.

07:42.200 --> 07:45.080
This sword is a fake after all.

07:46.130 --> 07:48.810
If that strike had been used for assassination,

07:49.310 --> 07:50.270
no one in the entire Yiqi Alliance

07:50.270 --> 07:52.159
would probably have been able to resist.

07:52.159 --> 07:54.159
With such a master in Beast Kingdom,

07:54.870 --> 07:57.159
didn't you receive any news, Yuan?

08:02.600 --> 08:03.190
Yuan?

08:06.460 --> 08:07.700
It's my negligence.

08:15.850 --> 08:17.200
It's not your fault.

08:18.040 --> 08:19.920
Since my location has been exposed,

08:19.920 --> 08:22.180
I can't stay in Ruyi Pavilion any longer.

08:22.390 --> 08:24.920
Yuan, will you be in danger?

08:26.120 --> 08:27.120
Don't worry.

08:27.660 --> 08:29.990
I'll just say you're my important client.

08:30.120 --> 08:31.510
Qingmu's has been doing business in Beast Kingdom

08:31.510 --> 08:33.200
for many years.

08:33.320 --> 08:34.780
We have some connections.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.200
Quzhuo should be back soon.

08:39.370 --> 08:42.289
Just make two new identity tokens for us.

08:42.750 --> 08:44.360
The identity tokens of the Beast Kingdom

08:44.360 --> 08:46.080
are made from hematite.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.790
And the mines are controlled by the ruler.

08:48.790 --> 08:51.720
I barely managed to get two pieces,

08:51.960 --> 08:54.020
and you've used them to save someone.

08:54.960 --> 08:55.870
Yuan,

08:57.710 --> 08:58.770
you must have a way.

08:59.910 --> 09:01.200
There is a way.

09:02.510 --> 09:05.970
In the Beast Kingdom, demons are the property of demon tamers.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.860
They don't need identity tokens.

09:08.440 --> 09:11.390
You want us to pose as demons?

09:11.910 --> 09:15.200
If you want to continue investigating in the Beast Kingdom and stay low-key,

09:15.200 --> 09:16.750
this is the only way left.

09:18.620 --> 09:21.380
It won't be a problem for Quzhuo

09:22.270 --> 09:23.920
to make a demon core.

09:24.440 --> 09:26.700
But which of us is going to pose as a demon?

09:27.720 --> 09:28.720
What do you think?

09:44.960 --> 09:46.880
Dongfang Huaizhu,

09:47.790 --> 09:49.670
you think you can escape?

09:52.740 --> 09:55.290
I've long since become one with you.

09:55.910 --> 10:00.030
Right now, I'm just being temporarily suppressed.

10:32.040 --> 10:34.690
If that strike had been used for assassination,

10:34.690 --> 10:35.750
no one in the entire Yiqi Alliance

10:35.750 --> 10:38.010
would probably have been able to resist.

10:44.990 --> 10:46.170
Is it you?

11:06.270 --> 11:07.390
You're injured.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.750
It's pretty serious.

11:10.550 --> 11:11.510
It's nothing.

11:12.910 --> 11:15.910
Why do you live in such a rundown place?

11:17.970 --> 11:18.930
I'm used to it.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.670
You're the esteemed Master of the Zhang family.

11:21.670 --> 11:24.200
Why do you subject yourself to such hardship?

11:26.910 --> 11:27.720
Where are you going?

11:27.720 --> 11:29.120
To find something to eat.

11:29.240 --> 11:30.080
Ran.

11:36.200 --> 11:37.800
Wangquan Hongye is not dead.

11:38.910 --> 11:40.710
I'll find another opportunity.

11:42.910 --> 11:44.840
Don't call me by that name anymore.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.910
Ran is already dead.

12:03.880 --> 12:12.780
[Drunken Dream Tower]

12:05.080 --> 12:06.940
Come in, please. Come in, please.

12:08.840 --> 12:09.770
Please, come in.

12:12.030 --> 12:13.890
Come in, please. Come in, please.

12:16.750 --> 12:17.870
Why can they go in,

12:17.870 --> 12:19.080
but we can't?

12:20.840 --> 12:23.850
Ladies, you don't even know the rules of Drunken Dream Tower.

12:23.850 --> 12:25.520
Why do you want to join the commotion?

12:25.520 --> 12:26.560
What do you mean?

12:27.000 --> 12:29.330
What rules does Drunken Dream Tower have?

12:29.470 --> 12:33.530
Without a demon, you're not qualified to participate in the Demon Fight.

12:34.350 --> 12:36.210
What is Demon Fight?

12:36.720 --> 12:40.030
This is the place where demon tamers bring demons to fight.

12:40.610 --> 12:41.700
It's good that you know.

12:41.700 --> 12:44.960
[Drunken Dream Tower]

12:42.070 --> 12:43.910
If you want to enter Drunken Dream Tower,

12:43.910 --> 12:45.890
you must participate in the Demon Fight.

12:45.890 --> 12:47.620
Otherwise, there's no chance.

12:52.030 --> 12:52.750
Let's go.

12:54.750 --> 12:55.540
Bye.

12:55.600 --> 12:59.440
[Drunken Dream Tower]

12:56.670 --> 12:57.940
Sirs.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.810
Please come in, please come in.

13:01.750 --> 13:03.080
It's alright, Huaizhu.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.750
Tomorrow I'll catch two small demons,

13:04.750 --> 13:06.210
and we'll be able to get in.

13:12.270 --> 13:14.270
Where did these pastries come from?

13:25.710 --> 13:27.260
Miss Huaizhu, you're back.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.510
Am I not a person?

13:29.510 --> 13:30.840
Why didn't you greet me?

13:31.750 --> 13:33.010
Hello, Master Qinlan!

13:33.150 --> 13:34.360
Who's your master?

13:35.750 --> 13:36.670
You're back.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.530
The food will be ready soon.

13:40.730 --> 13:42.090
So, all in all,

13:42.270 --> 13:44.400
you two are here to seek refuge with us?

13:44.750 --> 13:47.120
Collaboration. It's called collaboration.

13:47.120 --> 13:48.250
Watch your wording.

13:48.560 --> 13:50.620
I don't want to collaborate with you.

13:51.510 --> 13:53.080
Come on, how can you...

13:53.120 --> 13:54.000
Qinlan.

13:59.760 --> 14:01.360
So, you came here

14:01.390 --> 14:03.410
to investigate the Black Fox, right?

14:03.410 --> 14:06.650
Yes. But somehow our identities were exposed,

14:06.680 --> 14:08.540
and our whereabouts were leaked.

14:08.980 --> 14:11.380
Hongye even got attacked at Ruyi Pavilion.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.440
Are you injured?

14:13.670 --> 14:15.270
Don't worry, I'm fine.

14:18.840 --> 14:19.960
Then stay here.

14:20.180 --> 14:21.630
We can look out for each other.

14:21.630 --> 14:22.510
Huaizhu,

14:22.630 --> 14:24.320
this isn't just looking out for each other.

14:24.320 --> 14:26.650
It's more like you're taking care of them.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.390
You've hit the nail on the head.

14:28.390 --> 14:30.000
We're here to take care of you.

14:30.000 --> 14:30.750
Quzhuo.

14:33.630 --> 14:36.200
Here's the thing. We found some clues,

14:36.670 --> 14:37.870
which include...

14:38.030 --> 14:39.830
information about your mother.

14:41.270 --> 14:44.130
All of this might be related to Drunken Dream Tower.

14:45.080 --> 14:46.960
There's more information on the way,

14:46.960 --> 14:48.720
and Ruyi Pavilion will send it over bit by bit.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.840
And Quzhuo and I

14:49.910 --> 14:51.490
will continue to investigate further.

14:51.490 --> 14:53.360
You two? Investigate further?

14:53.410 --> 14:54.620
How?

14:54.750 --> 14:57.030
With that half-baked demon disguise talisman

14:57.030 --> 14:59.290
of yours that doesn't even last a minute?

14:59.360 --> 15:02.840
No. We'll turn into real demons.

15:03.750 --> 15:05.810
Why don't you try being a human first?

15:23.670 --> 15:25.200
Then I'll stop pretending.

15:30.150 --> 15:32.240
Let me properly introduce myself.

15:33.060 --> 15:35.510
I'm Li Quzhuo, the second son of the Li family from Peach Garden.

15:35.510 --> 15:36.910
Sit down and get to the point.

15:36.910 --> 15:37.910
Alright, Hongye.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.770
I can make demon cores.

15:42.030 --> 15:42.910
Demon cores?

15:44.380 --> 15:46.150
Quzhuo can make demon cores?

15:46.150 --> 15:47.030
That's impressive.

15:47.030 --> 15:47.910
Of course.

15:48.080 --> 15:49.790
Once Qingmu Yuan sends over the demon king's blood,

15:49.790 --> 15:50.740
I'll be able to make them.

15:50.740 --> 15:51.960
By then, when we take it,

15:51.960 --> 15:52.750
we'll become demons.

15:52.750 --> 15:54.680
After that, Mrs. Wangquan, you...

16:01.960 --> 16:03.150
Miss Huaizhu.

16:03.850 --> 16:06.680
Miss Huaizhu, you'll see for yourself.

16:08.050 --> 16:10.870
Alright. But there's no bedroom left.

16:11.150 --> 16:12.280
Where will you stay?

16:12.840 --> 16:15.000
We can tidy up the wood shed

16:15.000 --> 16:15.910
and stay there.

16:16.630 --> 16:17.360
You do it.

16:21.670 --> 16:22.550
I...

16:22.570 --> 16:24.660
Alright, I'll do it.

16:33.150 --> 16:34.750
Beast Kingdom has been conducting strict inspections lately.

16:34.750 --> 16:36.690
I only managed to get these two bottles of demon blood.

16:36.690 --> 16:38.200
One is from a snake demon,

16:38.200 --> 16:40.000
and the other is from a dog demon.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.120
Hongye,

16:42.120 --> 16:44.630
do you know the consequences of consuming

16:44.630 --> 16:46.490
the heart's blood of a demon king?

16:46.510 --> 16:48.240
With Quzhuo here, don't worry.

16:48.240 --> 16:50.390
I'll use the gourd to strip away the demon's influence,

16:50.390 --> 16:52.030
and there won't be any problems.

16:52.030 --> 16:53.760
It's not as simple as you think.

16:53.980 --> 16:55.740
Once you consume demon blood,

16:55.790 --> 16:57.150
you'll lose the ability to use magic power

16:57.150 --> 16:58.700
and can only use demonic power.

16:58.700 --> 17:01.400
Additionally, your behavior will be influenced by the demon nature,

17:01.400 --> 17:04.010
which could become your fatal weakness.

17:04.390 --> 17:05.819
Especially snake demons.

17:05.819 --> 17:07.720
Their biggest weakness is their extreme fear of cold.

17:07.720 --> 17:08.720
In this desert area,

17:08.720 --> 17:11.680
once night falls, they'll become especially vulnerable.

17:11.680 --> 17:13.550
The demon nature will be gone in ten days.

17:13.550 --> 17:14.920
Yuan, you don't have to worry.

17:14.920 --> 17:15.920
I'll take the snake demon's blood.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.380
I'll take the dog demon's.

17:18.510 --> 17:19.240
This smell...

17:19.240 --> 17:20.109
Alright.

17:20.180 --> 17:21.589
I can't stop you two.

17:21.589 --> 17:22.640
I'll go back now.

17:29.990 --> 17:31.440
Quzhuo, you must not...

17:31.440 --> 17:32.170
Don't worry.

17:32.760 --> 17:34.760
I won't let Mrs. Wangquan know.

17:35.000 --> 17:35.720
Let's go.

17:42.750 --> 17:45.030
I've already infused the demon king's blood

17:45.030 --> 17:47.030
that Miss Qingmu brought here in it.

17:47.440 --> 17:48.960
You're just being mysterious.

17:48.960 --> 17:50.720
Isn't it just swallowing demon blood?

17:50.720 --> 17:51.750
What do you know?

17:52.400 --> 17:55.200
I first used the gourd to strip away the demon's influence,

17:55.200 --> 17:57.880
then purified the demon blood until it's as clear as glass.

17:57.880 --> 17:59.140
Only then was it ready.

17:59.640 --> 18:01.510
You won't lose your true natures, will you?

18:01.510 --> 18:03.110
You don't need to worry about that.

18:03.110 --> 18:06.240
The demon nature will definitely be gone after ten days.

18:06.240 --> 18:08.350
Although we won't be able to use spiritual power,

18:08.350 --> 18:09.880
we can use demonic power.

18:10.070 --> 18:11.830
Yes, and ten days will be enough

18:12.030 --> 18:14.490
for us to complete the task in Beast Kingdom.

18:15.640 --> 18:17.300
What kind of demons are these?

18:17.860 --> 18:20.270
The purple one is a snake demon core,

18:20.270 --> 18:22.350
and the silver one is a dog demon core.

18:53.760 --> 18:54.590
Normally,

18:54.590 --> 18:56.680
the demonic nature only stirs after midnight.

18:56.680 --> 18:57.750
When that happens,

18:57.920 --> 18:59.000
as long as we stay relaxed,

18:59.000 --> 19:00.530
there should be no problem.

19:00.750 --> 19:03.000
Alright then, we'll wait and see.

19:08.240 --> 19:10.200
The temperature difference between day and night

19:10.200 --> 19:13.130
in Beast Kingdom during autumn is shockingly large.

19:14.360 --> 19:16.290
Why haven't those two come out yet?

19:16.960 --> 19:18.960
After all, they are demon king level.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.640
It may take some time.

19:20.790 --> 19:23.650
See? They have low comprehension and can't be used.

19:31.070 --> 19:34.590
Young Master Li finally gets to show off for once.

20:02.560 --> 20:05.670
Puppy Li, is that really you?

20:07.650 --> 20:08.610
Huaizhu,

20:08.640 --> 20:11.150
it looks like turning into a demon doesn't make one smarter.

20:11.150 --> 20:12.860
I bet that Young Master Wangquan

20:12.860 --> 20:15.780
isn't any better than this little dog.

20:18.070 --> 20:19.200
I'll go check on him.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.070
Puppy Li.

21:13.260 --> 21:14.060
Huaizhu.

21:24.830 --> 21:26.310
Isn't he supposed to be a demon king?

21:26.310 --> 21:27.920
Why can't he even walk?

21:30.240 --> 21:32.640
His demonization is not yet complete.

21:32.640 --> 21:35.070
But he already has the snake's sleepy nature.

21:35.070 --> 21:35.950
Qinlan,

21:36.790 --> 21:38.200
help me get him inside.

21:38.510 --> 21:39.840
I'm not going to do that.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.880
Puppy Li, you go help him.

22:07.830 --> 22:10.240
Li Quzhuo!

22:10.830 --> 22:13.700
Get out here!

22:29.620 --> 22:30.300
I...

22:32.400 --> 22:35.790
I turned into a dog last night?

22:36.000 --> 22:38.060
You did more than just turn into a dog.

22:38.110 --> 22:39.510
Look at what you've done.

22:50.240 --> 22:52.070
Puppy Li,

22:52.140 --> 22:55.200
you're such a big dog, yet you're still wetting the bed.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.070
Well...

23:04.590 --> 23:05.550
Are you hungry?

23:07.030 --> 23:07.920
Yes.

23:21.190 --> 23:23.000
I checked the kitchen and this is all we've got,

23:23.000 --> 23:24.640
so I'll make some hot and sour soup.

23:24.640 --> 23:27.120
Tomorrow I'll go out and buy some meat

23:27.330 --> 23:29.390
so we can make pork and scallion buns.

23:29.570 --> 23:31.520
My sister doesn't like pork and scallion buns.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.400
Then how about scallion and pork buns?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.610
You...

23:34.970 --> 23:35.940
You dog.

23:36.900 --> 23:39.300
Three-vegetable filling, how about that?

23:42.390 --> 23:44.470
I didn't expect you to be such a good cook.

23:44.470 --> 23:46.310
Of course, in Mask...

23:50.710 --> 23:51.560
I...

23:51.580 --> 23:53.880
I'm always the one who cooks when I'm with my friends.

23:53.880 --> 23:55.740
Even my brother can only help out.

24:06.810 --> 24:08.360
What's this?

24:14.130 --> 24:16.300
It's so refreshing.

24:16.720 --> 24:17.520
Alright then.

24:17.730 --> 24:20.390
I'll forgive you for wetting the bed last night.

24:21.280 --> 24:22.750
That was just my exceptional talent.

24:22.750 --> 24:24.750
I fused with the demon core quickly.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.870
How's my brother doing?

25:23.070 --> 25:23.960
What's wrong?

25:26.350 --> 25:28.410
Is there something strange about me?

25:29.400 --> 25:30.200
No.

25:36.830 --> 25:38.350
I don't even remember

25:38.640 --> 25:40.240
how I fell asleep last night.

25:40.250 --> 25:42.550
Last night, Quzhuo transformed into his demon form.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.510
You didn't.

25:44.350 --> 25:47.510
But your inner energy is still unstable.

25:48.070 --> 25:49.730
You need some time to recover.

25:54.030 --> 25:55.090
What are you doing?

25:55.200 --> 25:58.030
I'm planning to offer free consultations at the pharmacy.

25:58.030 --> 25:59.930
That way, I can interact with more people and demons

25:59.930 --> 26:03.060
and gather more information through various channels.

26:03.680 --> 26:05.080
Then I'll go out with you.

26:05.920 --> 26:07.380
I have an appointment today as well.

26:07.380 --> 26:08.690
By yourself?

26:08.710 --> 26:09.560
Don't worry.

26:09.590 --> 26:12.300
Once I'm done, I'll go find you at the pharmacy

26:12.480 --> 26:15.060
and we'll go home together.

26:17.880 --> 26:20.020
Huaizhu, time to eat.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.470
Let's go.

26:32.130 --> 26:35.530
Huaizhu, let me go with you for the free consultations later.

26:36.130 --> 26:37.290
Let me go with your sister.

26:37.290 --> 26:38.770
You can't even walk.

26:38.830 --> 26:40.490
How are you going to get there?

26:43.410 --> 26:44.610
I can control myself.

26:46.110 --> 26:48.550
Also, Miss Qinlan.

26:49.400 --> 26:50.690
I have a favor to ask.

26:51.610 --> 26:54.400
Quzhuo's demon core hasn't fully fused with him yet.

26:54.400 --> 26:56.930
He needs someone to train and take care of him.

26:57.070 --> 26:59.880
Miss Qinlan, you're intelligent,

26:59.920 --> 27:01.750
and your magical power is profound.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.880
Most importantly,

27:03.790 --> 27:05.960
you are kind and patient.

27:06.920 --> 27:09.400
Could you please help Quzhuo?

27:17.220 --> 27:18.220
Yes, yes, yes.

27:20.550 --> 27:22.120
Please help me.

27:22.920 --> 27:25.110
But your demonization isn't complete yet.

27:25.110 --> 27:27.370
Won't you just be a burden if you go there?

27:27.440 --> 27:28.440
Well...

27:53.400 --> 27:54.650
You can control water?

27:54.650 --> 27:57.210
I just slightly adjusted my demonic aura

27:57.240 --> 27:58.240
and did it.

28:00.440 --> 28:04.160
It seems that the way demon cores take effect varies.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.960
Qinlan,

28:12.110 --> 28:15.790
could you please help take care of Young Master Li?

28:17.900 --> 28:19.070
Master,

28:20.130 --> 28:22.250
I really need your help.

28:25.510 --> 28:27.200
Thank you, Miss Qinlan.

28:31.950 --> 28:33.670
Huaizhu, let's go.

28:39.680 --> 28:40.960
Just now, my brother...

28:40.960 --> 28:42.680
Water! He...

28:44.000 --> 28:45.200
just did it like that.

28:45.590 --> 28:47.030
Hongye truly lives up to his name.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.880
Outstanding people are always outstanding.

28:48.880 --> 28:50.790
So, what's your demon skill, Second Young Master

28:50.790 --> 28:52.590
of the Li family from Peach Garden?

28:52.590 --> 28:54.070
My...

28:54.440 --> 28:55.750
My demon skill...

28:55.750 --> 28:57.010
Is it being a loyal dog?

29:06.170 --> 29:11.270
[Herb Clinic]

29:07.030 --> 29:08.960
I have good news for everyone.

29:09.110 --> 29:10.720
Miss Erzhu said that

29:10.880 --> 29:14.350
both humans and demons can get free consultations.

29:14.740 --> 29:16.160
Don't be afraid.

29:16.160 --> 29:17.830
Everyone can come in for a consultation.

29:17.830 --> 29:20.750
There's really a demon tamer willing to offer free consultations for demons?

29:20.750 --> 29:22.150
Thank you, Miss Erzhu.

29:22.590 --> 29:23.580
Come in.

29:23.690 --> 29:24.310
Let's go too, then.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.160
Is it true?

29:25.160 --> 29:26.060
It's true.

29:26.150 --> 29:27.110
You're not deceiving us?

29:27.110 --> 29:27.960
Just come in.

29:28.140 --> 29:31.910
[Herb Clinic]

29:28.450 --> 29:29.330
Come in.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.540
Please come in.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.570
Prince Bumu.

29:56.360 --> 29:57.600
Long time no see.

29:59.350 --> 30:00.400
How have you been?

30:01.830 --> 30:03.530
[Prince Bumu, Brother of Beast Kingdom's King]

30:04.310 --> 30:05.550
Young Master Wangquan?

30:05.550 --> 30:06.640
You are...

30:09.390 --> 30:10.170
Thanks to you,

30:10.170 --> 30:11.430
I've been doing well.

30:11.950 --> 30:13.080
That's good to hear.

30:13.440 --> 30:15.440
I assume you're here on some mission

30:15.750 --> 30:17.510
with this disguise?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.350
To be honest,

30:20.840 --> 30:23.360
I'm here with a request.

30:24.880 --> 30:27.460
You once helped me out in my time of need,

30:27.480 --> 30:28.880
and I'll never forget it.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.080
Please, just tell me.

30:30.160 --> 30:31.120
I want to know

30:32.000 --> 30:33.720
what happened to Jiuhuo and the Black Fox

30:33.720 --> 30:35.510
in Beast Kingdom back then.

30:36.400 --> 30:38.920
And Jiang Juanxue, the Northern Hill Sect's Saintess.

30:38.920 --> 30:41.910
How did Erzhu Yu, the owner of Drunken Dream Tower

30:42.270 --> 30:43.400
she trained, die?

30:48.350 --> 30:51.550
This dungeon was once the altar of the Northern Hill Sect.

30:51.750 --> 30:53.080
Five hundred years ago,

30:53.270 --> 30:56.370
the celestial demon Jiuhuo was sealed here.

30:56.440 --> 30:58.900
Jiuhuo was sealed by the Northern Hill Sect?

31:00.220 --> 31:01.620
Why was he sealed?

31:01.750 --> 31:03.350
I don't know the details.

31:03.750 --> 31:04.590
Young Master,

31:05.510 --> 31:07.040
please follow me to a place.

31:15.750 --> 31:16.440
We're here.

31:22.080 --> 31:25.880
This is the secret chamber of our Beast Kingdom's national fortune.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.960
This is no ordinary barrier.

31:29.650 --> 31:31.510
It cannot be broken through by force.

31:31.510 --> 31:32.400
Indeed.

31:32.960 --> 31:36.960
This barrier was set up during the peak period of the Northern Hill Sect.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.620
The Northern Hill Sect again?

31:40.510 --> 31:42.180
I received information that

31:42.250 --> 31:44.720
the Northern Hill Sect is related to the origin of the Black Fox.

31:44.720 --> 31:45.590
So,

31:45.640 --> 31:48.280
there might be something here that you need.

31:52.490 --> 31:54.030
How can I get inside?

31:55.130 --> 31:58.990
Only the ruler carrying the royal seal can enter.

32:01.240 --> 32:03.840
What if I find someone from the Northern Hill Sect?

32:03.840 --> 32:06.160
After Erzhu Yu's death, the Northern Hill Sect

32:06.160 --> 32:07.420
has already perished.

32:07.430 --> 32:08.360
Perished?

32:14.270 --> 32:17.030
Erzhu Yu was assassinated?

32:17.960 --> 32:18.880
Yes.

32:20.600 --> 32:22.790
Did she leave anything behind?

32:25.440 --> 32:27.070
Now that you mention it,

32:27.560 --> 32:30.490
there was indeed something strange after her death.

32:30.880 --> 32:34.050
Erzhu Yu was the owner of Drunken Dream Tower.

32:34.270 --> 32:35.400
After her death,

32:35.460 --> 32:39.190
the Demon Fights at Drunken Dream Tower have become more frequent.

32:40.110 --> 32:41.440
Demon Fights?

32:46.660 --> 32:47.390
It's over?

32:51.160 --> 32:51.750
What is it?

32:51.750 --> 32:52.350
Date cake.

33:03.340 --> 33:04.940
Did you find anything today?

33:06.490 --> 33:07.580
Not much.

33:08.610 --> 33:10.990
Everyone says Drunken Dream Tower is a money pit

33:10.990 --> 33:12.190
and heavily guarded.

33:12.750 --> 33:14.720
Apart from hosting the Demon Fights,

33:14.720 --> 33:16.750
ordinary people can't get in at all.

33:18.400 --> 33:20.460
Let's grab something to eat up ahead.

33:23.170 --> 33:26.600
♪ Perhaps love happens ♪

33:27.140 --> 33:29.070
♪ When my heart blooms because of you ♪

33:29.740 --> 33:34.460
♪ So love rests within my heart ♪

33:36.030 --> 33:38.250
Has your demonic aura settled down a bit?

33:38.250 --> 33:39.450
How about you take a look?

33:38.390 --> 33:40.930
♪ Love comes from love ♪

33:41.290 --> 33:43.960
♪ Please don't mind ♪

33:45.360 --> 33:49.050
♪ Sincerity can nourish sincerity ♪

33:52.300 --> 33:54.650
♪ No need for worldly arrangements ♪

33:55.210 --> 33:56.710
♪ The dialogue in our breaths ♪

33:57.480 --> 34:03.030
♪ In our gaze, there's a bright, tender feeling hidden ♪

34:04.710 --> 34:07.740
♪ I don't love to be loved ♪

34:08.110 --> 34:11.170
♪ When my eyes meet your expectations ♪

34:11.820 --> 34:15.710
♪ It confirms that our souls are stirring ♪

34:16.270 --> 34:17.969
♪ And awakening ♪

34:18.590 --> 34:21.989
♪ Perhaps love happens ♪

34:22.600 --> 34:24.670
♪ When my heart blooms because of you ♪

34:25.219 --> 34:30.020
♪ So love rests within my heart ♪

34:32.540 --> 34:36.090
♪ But love is more vast and free ♪

34:36.620 --> 34:38.639
♪ Than romantic love ♪

34:36.670 --> 34:37.960
Your heart is broken.

34:39.280 --> 34:41.380
♪ If we part ♪

34:42.040 --> 34:44.420
♪ We will still love each other gently ♪

34:44.320 --> 34:45.590
But every single piece

34:45.920 --> 34:47.120
still belongs to you.

35:03.410 --> 35:04.260
Shake hands.

35:06.070 --> 35:07.270
Come on, shake hands.

35:12.030 --> 35:13.280
Good boy.

35:13.300 --> 35:16.300
Make the "Congratulations and Prosperity" gesture.

35:16.630 --> 35:18.470
Do it.

35:20.110 --> 35:22.040
Congratulations and Prosperity.

35:29.700 --> 35:31.890
Quzhuo, what are you doing?

35:32.070 --> 35:32.670
Huaizhu.

35:32.670 --> 35:34.360
Hongye, she...

35:35.360 --> 35:39.240
I was just trying to stimulate his demonic power.

35:39.590 --> 35:41.630
I tried using spiritual fire, but it didn't work,

35:41.630 --> 35:44.030
so I figured I'd try something more primal.

35:46.110 --> 35:47.150
Alright, no more practice.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.030
Go make dinner.

35:51.370 --> 35:53.170
You've been training me all day.

35:53.420 --> 35:55.160
Now she tells me to cook!

35:55.400 --> 35:57.230
It's the punishment for meddling

35:57.230 --> 35:59.030
and trying to randomly match people up.

35:59.030 --> 36:00.150
Don't talk nonsense.

36:00.150 --> 36:02.440
Alright. You don't need to cook today.

36:02.650 --> 36:05.510
Huaizhu and I bought roast chicken, your favorite.

36:05.520 --> 36:06.700
Roast chicken?

36:09.000 --> 36:09.990
Give it to me!

36:10.230 --> 36:10.840
Give it to me!

36:10.840 --> 36:11.720
Puppy Li!

36:14.590 --> 36:15.870
Puppy Li!

36:24.400 --> 36:26.320
I've noticed that since Quzhuo met your sister,

36:26.320 --> 36:27.670
he's found his nemesis.

36:29.270 --> 36:31.860
The two of them seem to get along quite well.

36:33.280 --> 36:34.630
Do you plan to tell her

36:34.710 --> 36:37.030
that you're a member of the Mask Group?

36:38.940 --> 36:41.710
What worries me is that the Mask Group, due to its demon sympathies,

36:41.710 --> 36:43.770
is not accepted by the Yiqi Alliance.

36:43.920 --> 36:45.880
So after thinking it through, I feel

36:45.880 --> 36:47.880
it's better if Qinlan doesn't know.

36:49.400 --> 36:50.710
Look at her now.

36:51.390 --> 36:52.190
Isn't it good?

36:55.730 --> 36:57.330
Then let's wait a bit longer.

36:58.150 --> 37:00.350
Tell her when you feel the time is right.

37:04.800 --> 37:06.860
These past few days in Beast Kingdom,

37:07.210 --> 37:08.810
I've discovered something.

37:10.230 --> 37:10.960
What is it?

37:21.150 --> 37:22.810
The Black Fox's demonic aura?

37:30.650 --> 37:32.430
Didn't the Rebirth Pool purify it?

37:32.430 --> 37:35.490
It seems it was only temporarily suppressed.

37:35.670 --> 37:37.880
The Black Fox's demonic aura is still inside me

37:37.880 --> 37:39.760
and could return at any time.

37:45.660 --> 37:47.110
The real reason I came here

37:47.110 --> 37:49.960
is that my mother left me a clue in her letter.

37:50.550 --> 37:54.000
She told me to go to Drunken Dream Tower, find someone named Erzhu Yu,

37:54.000 --> 37:56.460
and make sure I get the Twilight Mist Flower.

37:56.590 --> 37:57.440
However...

37:57.580 --> 37:59.110
Erzhu Yu was assassinated.

37:59.840 --> 38:00.710
You know that?

38:02.960 --> 38:04.710
The information I received is that

38:04.710 --> 38:06.230
Erzhu Yu, like your mother,

38:06.230 --> 38:07.920
was from the Northern Hill Sect.

38:07.920 --> 38:11.400
And the Northern Hill Sect is related to the origin of the Black Fox.

38:11.400 --> 38:14.760
But the Northern Hill Sect has already perished.

38:15.920 --> 38:18.550
The Black Fox and the Northern Hill Sect?

38:21.950 --> 38:23.950
I also met Prince Bumu today.

38:24.430 --> 38:27.630
He also mentioned the Drunken Dream Tower you just brought up.

38:27.630 --> 38:29.330
He said that after Erzhu Yu's death,

38:29.330 --> 38:32.510
the Demon Fights there have been held more and more frequently,

38:32.510 --> 38:33.770
which is very unusual.

38:35.760 --> 38:38.800
It seems that Drunken Dream Tower is the key.
